constitutes severe academic misconduct under Federation University Australia
regulations.

This repository is publicly indexed across global search engines, web crawlers,
and academic plagiarism detection systems (including Turnitin). Any unauthorized
submission will be detected automatically and flagged with 100% similarity against
this publicly timestamped and cryptographically signed repository.

